      "etiology": "APL is caused by an acquired somatic genetic rearrangement in a hematopoietic precursor; it is not inherited from the patient or contagious. Most cases arise de novo. A minority occur after prior cytotoxic therapy, but an individual patient usually has no preventable initiating exposure.",
