      "differential": "Differentiate DLBCL from Burkitt lymphoma, defined high-grade B-cell lymphomas, primary mediastinal large B-cell lymphoma, transformed follicular lymphoma, Hodgkin lymphoma, B-lymphoblastic lymphoma, plasmablastic lymphoma, reactive or infectious lymphadenopathy, and metastatic malignancy. Classification matters because treatment intensity, CNS strategy, and prognosis differ.",
