      "differential": "Differentiate Burkitt lymphoma from DLBCL, MYC and BCL2-rearranged lymphoma, high-grade B-cell lymphoma not otherwise specified, high-grade B-cell lymphoma with 11q aberration, B-lymphoblastic lymphoma, blastoid mantle-cell lymphoma, and plasmablastic lymphoma. These are not interchangeable labels or protocols.",
