      "definition": "Alport syndrome is an inherited type IV collagen disorder caused by pathogenic variants in COL4A3, COL4A4, or COL4A5. Abnormal basement membranes first cause persistent hematuria and later proteinuria and kidney failure; the same collagen network in the cochlea and eye explains associated sensorineural hearing loss and ocular findings.",
